REPRODUCTION FROM THIS KIT
Large master/review PNGs, runtime/model binaries and intermediate tiles are excluded. Install a compatible Linux/Python environment with NumPy and Pillow. Several GB of RAM are required per process. From the extracted kit directory:
python -m pip install --target inference/runtime --no-deps ncnn==1.0.20250916
curl -fL -o official_models_bundle.zip https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.5.0/realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan-20220424-ubuntu.zip
unzip official_models_bundle.zip 'models/realesrgan-x4plus-anime.*' -d inference
python inference/run_isolated.py "$PWD/native_floor.png" "$PWD/ai_upscale"
LANTERN_AI_RUNTIME="$PWD/inference" python inference/check_scene_seams.py "$PWD"
python inference/build_scene_review.py "$PWD"

The inference and seam scripts are the restored byte-for-byte scripts from the earlier source kit. build_scene_review.py only adapts the restored hero-path resolution to portable scene-relative references; its original is also included. This extracted-kit installation flow was not separately retested. Matching source/config tiles support resume; the source hash protects against cross-source reuse. The commands reproduce processing, not the image-generation service.

